# Standalone dotnet projects under .agents/ (the offline preview tools and harnesses) are
# their own projects. The /bin and /obj rules above are root-anchored and miss nested
# projects, so their build output needs explicit rules or it gets committed.
.agents/**/bin/
.agents/**/obj/
